Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.63,0:00:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.85,0:00:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.77,0:00:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Yu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.31,0:00:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.31,0:00:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.25,0:01:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't scare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.05,0:01:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll find a way to crush your\Noversized scorpion, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.17,0:01:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be quite an achievement,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.09,0:01:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,considering my mystical beast circuit is
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.17,0:01:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,more powerful than all\Nthree of your monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.65,0:01:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.56,0:01:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.47,0:01:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The only question is, which is\Nthe first one it should devour?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.51,0:01:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's pointless for you to\Ntry and stop my ancient creature,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.89,0:01:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,because there's not a card in your\Ndeck powerful enough to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.87,0:01:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be some way he can fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.75,0:01:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.09,0:01:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yugi, my brother can\Nstill win this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.87,0:01:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, even though Merrick has the\Nupper hand, Joey can still beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.51,0:01:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He just needs to find the\Nweakness of Merrick's mystical
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.51,0:01:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,beast before it wipes out\Nthe rest of his life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.47,0:01:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the card locked inside the Ark?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.43,0:01:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The winged dragon of Roth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.85,0:01:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's Merrick's Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.39,0:02:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey needs to get Merrick's life points\Ndown to zero before Merrick plays that card!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.89,0:02:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, Joey won't stand a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.07,0:02:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Merrick, why did you place\Nyour Egyptian God card in my deck?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.37,0:02:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're going to deceive these\Nfools into believing you are me,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.29,0:02:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,you must duel as I would, Odeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.77,0:02:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, the Winged Dragon of Ra in\Nyour deck is only a copy of the original.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.55,0:02:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't risk losing the most\Npowerful Egyptian god card in creation
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.57,0:02:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So I had the rare hunters reproduce\Ncounterfeit cards. These forgeries are
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.47,0:02:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,exact duplicates of the original winged\Ndragon of Ra and equally as powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.95,0:02:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The rare hunters tested each sample\Nuntil we got it just right Of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.85,0:02:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,when you're dealing with\Na creature of such power,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.41,0:02:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,things can get quite dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.89,0:02:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Needless to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.55,0:03:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Many of my obedient servants had\Ndifficulties with these cards. For not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.59,0:03:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone can control the incredible\Npower of an Egyptian god monster
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.53,0:03:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Eventually,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.44,0:03:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I realized that only individuals\Nwho possess a certain connection
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.07,0:03:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,to the ancient scriptures Can\Nsuccessfully use an Egyptian god card
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.51,0:03:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And I have no doubt, Odeon, that you\Nwill be successful when you play it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.67,0:03:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Master Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.67,0:03:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm sure I can finish this\Nduel without taking that chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.31,0:03:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Mr. Wheeler,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.11,0:03:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,it's time for you to make your final move\Nbefore my mystical beast annihilates you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.33,0:03:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to my swords of revealing\Nlight, you still can't attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.37,0:03:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.37,0:03:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So here it goes. I play.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.89,0:03:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.21,0:03:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,A polymerization card?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.01,0:03:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's no help now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.43,0:03:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta find some way\Nto take out his mystical
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.21,0:03:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,beast before it knocks\Nme out of the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.85,0:03:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep all my monsters in\Ndefense mode and take my chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.25,0:03:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What's his strategy, Mai?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.03,0:04:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, all he can do is\Nbuy himself a little time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.15,0:04:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,A desperate move.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.91,0:04:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.09,0:04:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai Beast can't be stopped,\Nso feel his ancient fury.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.25,0:04:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack his Jinso now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.89,0:04:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,My mystical beast not only\Ndestroys the monsters it attacks,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.39,0:04:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,it also absorbs their power,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.47,0:04:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,making it even stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.49,0:04:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.97,0:04:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but it can.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.53,0:04:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And now half of Jinzo's attack\Npower is added to my beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.15,0:04:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That wasn't the only side effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.65,0:04:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's bigger and uglier, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.73,0:04:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If it continues destroying\NJoey's monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.53,0:04:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That means Marek's monster's attack\Nstrength will just continue to increase.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.95,0:04:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Till it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.85,0:04:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't scare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.37,0:04:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.49,0:04:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it looks like I got a pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.39,0:04:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So just go. I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.83,0:04:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The pleasure is all mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.69,0:05:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Mystical Beast,\Nattack his Insect Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.89,0:05:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,By absorbing the power of your Queen, my
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.49,0:05:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,creature grows even\Nstronger there's no stopping
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.81,0:05:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,me mr wheeler you're
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.69,0:05:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,finished joey hang in
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.81,0:05:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,there yeah this joker has\Nnothing on you farewell
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.95,0:05:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.23,0:05:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.95,0:05:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.95,0:05:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity, come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.51,0:05:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't leave me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.35,0:05:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.79,0:05:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get through this\Nduel without you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.23,0:05:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my biggest inspiration, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.11,0:05:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you mean that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.01,0:05:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.92,0:05:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do you think I\Nget all my courage from?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.09,0:05:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,From you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.17,0:05:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.65,0:05:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So you gotta stay here and cheer me on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.39,0:05:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only way I can win this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.87,0:05:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it, big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.37,0:05:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I've known comfort like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.51,0:06:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Family can chase away the shadows\Nof fear, like a light from above.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.83,0:06:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I was only an infant,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.87,0:06:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can still remember that cold,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.11,0:06:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,dark night when I felt the\Nlights for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.27,0:06:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,There, there, you poor sweet thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.25,0:06:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,She gave me shelter from the cold\Nand brought me into her home,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.43,0:06:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,deep below the desert sands, to\Nraise me as if I were her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.39,0:06:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,All was peaceful until the day\NI discovered my family's secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.49,0:06:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,For generations, our clan has served the\Ngreat pharaoh by guarding his ancient tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.95,0:06:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, our destiny is in jeopardy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.91,0:06:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Who will watch over the millennium rod\Nand necklace if we have no children?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.67,0:06:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,For 5,000 years, we've waited in the\Ndarkness for the pharaoh's return.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.99,0:06:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot fail him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.87,0:06:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But we have Odeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.41,0:06:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He can carry on our legacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.65,0:06:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you give him the\NTomb Keeper's initiation?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.69,0:06:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I already told you, Odeon\Nis not our flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.43,0:07:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He's our only hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.91,0:07:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It was fate that brought\Nhim to us on that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.45,0:07:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Please initiate Odeon\Nby his 12th birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.97,0:07:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,She's beautiful, and her\Nname shall be Ishizu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.63,0:07:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, after all these\Nyears, a child of our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.05,0:07:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,All we need now is a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.85,0:07:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear Odeon, you know I've\Nalways thought of you as my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.81,0:07:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But you cannot assume\Nthe family legacy until
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.93,0:07:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,you've been through the\NTomb Keeper's initiation,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.07,0:07:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,and you shall receive this sacred\Nrite on your 12th birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.55,0:07:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How will this change me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.33,0:07:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You will bear the ancient\Nscriptures, my child. You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.87,0:07:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That is if you still want to\Nbecome a tomb keeper. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.09,0:07:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, does this mean I'll be\Nexactly like you and Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.23,0:07:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.53,0:07:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You will truly be our son.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.29,0:08:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.65,0:08:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.97,0:08:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold him, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.13,0:08:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,A true heir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.39,0:08:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall call him Merrick. Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.45,0:08:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.83,0:08:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, are you all right? Just tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.63,0:08:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Promise me you'll always watch\Nout for your brother and sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.73,0:08:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.61,0:08:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.65,0:08:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,someday you shall\Nreceive the Tomb Keeper's
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.99,0:08:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,initiation as a lasting reminder\Nof your destiny, my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.87,0:08:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Our roles were defined.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.89,0:08:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,He was the chosen one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.43,0:08:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I was his protector.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.73,0:08:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get the ball, big\Nbrother. Here it is. Oh no,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.41,0:08:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick Help it bit me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.65,0:08:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You've disappointed me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.59,0:08:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Odeon, and that is\Nunacceptable. You vowed to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.29,0:08:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,that you would protect\NMerrick And now look at him,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.07,0:09:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Odeon He's my family's future. I'm sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.77,0:09:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,master Sorry's not enough Merrick's my\Nflesh and blood He must carry on my legacy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.35,0:09:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare leave Marek's side until\Nhis fever has passed and he is well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.85,0:09:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I command you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.61,0:09:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.13,0:09:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It was all my fault, big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.69,0:09:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.60,0:09:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let your father hear you say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.61,0:09:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.95,0:09:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You will always be my big brother, Odeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.31,0:09:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.83,0:09:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never let you down\Nagain, Master Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.75,0:09:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.17,0:09:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise to always protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.85,0:09:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So Merrick devoted his life to the ancient\Nscriptures, and I devoted my life to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.81,0:09:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.75,0:09:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.37,0:09:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But you need to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.87,0:09:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,At least have some soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.51,0:09:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I'm not hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.87,0:09:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.19,0:09:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Odeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.69,0:10:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon I'll receive the Tomb\NKeeper's initiation. Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.71,0:10:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it will be my job to wait\Nhere for the pharaoh to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.53,0:10:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be stuck down here\Nthe rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.07,0:10:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.31,0:10:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did I have to be born\Nthe son of a tomb keeper?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.01,0:10:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I have the initiation,\Nthere's no escaping my future.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.21,0:10:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Just thinking about it terrifies me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.11,0:10:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.02,0:10:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that I was born into this tradition,\Nthat it's my destiny. But why? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.95,0:10:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I have to give up\Nso much for this pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.85,0:10:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.73,0:10:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.37,0:10:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Your family saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.03,0:10:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can repay them by saving you from a
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.85,0:10:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,life of darkness inside\Nthe pharaoh's tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.01,0:10:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.49,0:10:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.41,0:10:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall ask for your\Nfather's consent right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.37,0:10:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,My family's sacred duty can\Nonly be passed to a true heir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.63,0:10:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not break tradition.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.85,0:11:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I'm not your real\Nson, but Master Marek is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.91,0:11:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,too frightened to go\Nthrough with the initiation
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.15,0:11:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't bear to see him\Nthis way Let me fulfill
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.85,0:11:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,the family's destiny and protect the tomb
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.57,0:11:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll devote my life so\NMaster Marek can be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.87,0:11:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,My son will receive the initiation as\Nplanned And you'll speak no more of this
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.03,0:11:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget when they\Ntook Merrick away. Help! Odeon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.71,0:11:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be a Tomb\NKeeper Please, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.49,0:11:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Odeon, stop them!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.87,0:11:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My life has changed forever Yes,\Nyou're a Tomb Keeper now Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.23,0:11:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I feel so alone Why should I\Nhave to pledge my life to some pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.37,0:12:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,As you know, I'm forbidden\Nto join this clan, so I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.41,0:12:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.59,0:12:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So I performed my own ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.95,0:12:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope this mark proves my\Nloyalty to your family, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.91,0:12:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.25,0:12:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since that day,\NMerrick was different.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.93,0:12:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It was as if that initiation\Ninfused him with an evil force.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.05,0:12:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Over the years, his\Nevil side grew stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.79,0:12:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Odeon, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.67,0:12:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.17,0:12:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish off Joey Wheeler so we can\Nmove on to our real opponents.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.41,0:12:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We must defeat Yugi and\NKaiba so I can win their
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.61,0:12:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Egyptian god cards and obtain\Nthe power of the pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.75,0:12:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.47,0:12:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't quit now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.95,0:12:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.43,0:12:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I come. Surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.05,0:12:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're helpless against\Nmy mystical beast circuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.25,0:12:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what you draw, it will never\Nmatch the power of my ancient creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.33,0:12:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And once I destroy your final monster,\NI'll wipe out the rest of your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.87,0:12:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still in this, Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.79,0:13:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.73,0:13:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to beat that thing\Nwith three useless magic cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.19,0:13:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll leave my fisherman in defense\Nmode and sit tight. Smart move.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.71,0:13:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But forfeiting this duel would\Nhave been an even smarter move.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.45,0:13:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Zip it, Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.77,0:13:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You may look creepy, but I'm not scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.19,0:13:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,and there's absolutely no way
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.85,0:13:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.76,0:13:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,My little sister can finally see me\Nduel, and I'll make sure she sees me win.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.17,0:13:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so, Mr. Wheeler?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.35,0:13:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,How very touching.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.03,0:13:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But nothing can save you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.45,0:13:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.79,0:13:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He's made some great comebacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.71,0:13:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But I think his streak will\Nfinally end here on this blimp.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.39,0:13:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He's definitely come a long way\Nsince the last time I dueled him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.89,0:13:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.80,0:13:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He did the best that he could. Wait, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.19,0:13:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at Joey's eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.27,0:13:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Your turn. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.49,0:13:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They burn with a fire that\NI've never seen in him before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.07,0:13:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like he knows he's going to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.57,0:13:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.75,0:14:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't think of a move that can save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.71,0:14:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What matters is what Joey\Nfeels in his heart, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.43,0:14:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,His determination to beat\NMerrick is very strong. And so,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.99,0:14:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey believes he's going to\Nwin this duel even though the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.25,0:14:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,likelihood of his victory over\NMerrick is extremely small.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.23,0:14:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He vowed to help me put an end to Merrick's\Nscheme and he's keeping his promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.91,0:14:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But how's Joey gonna stop this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.25,0:14:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If he trusts himself and the heart\Nof the cards, he'll find a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.03,0:14:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.45,0:14:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're so confident you'll win\Nthis, then make your move already.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.91,0:14:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.41,0:14:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand back as my mystical beast\Nswallows your last line of defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.83,0:14:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Your legendary fisherman is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.49,0:14:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't worry, its\Npower won't be wasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.39,0:14:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be absorbed by my mystical beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.91,0:14:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Mako.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.41,0:14:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to turn your\Ncard into a fish stick dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.67,0:14:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your last turn before I destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.39,0:14:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.85,0:15:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.23,0:15:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.99,0:15:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So make your big move.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.01,0:15:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.63,0:15:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.91,0:15:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He fought well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.23,0:15:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Only Merrick fought even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.31,0:15:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I won't get to see\NMerrick's Egyptian God card after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.41,0:15:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,After this attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.39,0:15:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's little friend will be finished.\NYou've served me well, Odeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.17,0:15:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna lose
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.77,0:15:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't explain how I know, but I got this\Nstrange feeling that I'm gonna win this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.25,0:15:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Duel! It's kinda like a voice inside my\Nhead. So go ahead and take your best shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.59,0:15:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick Oh, I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.25,0:15:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And as soon as my mystical beast\Nattacks your life points, it's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.31,0:15:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to lose now, so\Nsay goodbye to the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.59,0:15:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Before you make your final\Nattack and try to win this duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.85,0:15:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I got something I want to say to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.91,0:16:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget when\Nyou controlled my mind and
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.55,0:16:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,forced me to hurt my best\Nfriend in that crazy duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.73,0:16:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to destroy you\Nwith my Hinotama Magic Card!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.73,0:16:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't have the courage\Nto face Yuge yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.71,0:16:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,so you made me do your dirty\Nwork while you hid like a coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.33,0:16:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm facing you now, aren't I? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.11,0:16:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And look at the score.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.27,0:16:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm destroying you in a duel face-to-face.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.43,0:16:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's funny you bring that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.95,0:16:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,See, ever since we started this duel,\NI've had a weird feeling about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.45,0:16:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't put my finger on it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.99,0:16:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,but you don't seem like the same\Nguy that controlled my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.69,0:16:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That Marek's a regular slime ball,\Nbut you played a really fair duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.05,0:16:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,and it was one of the\Ntoughest ones I ever fought.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.77,0:16:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like I got a little\Nvoice deep inside me
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.79,0:16:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,that tells me there's\Nno way I'm gonna lose,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.11,0:16:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I also got a voice that tells\Nme you're not the rotten
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.27,0:16:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,snake that took over my brain\Nand forced me to duel Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.77,0:17:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.85,0:17:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.59,0:17:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I always trust what I feel in my gut.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.75,0:17:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And now it's telling me two things.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.97,0:17:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not who you're pretending\Nto be. And you won't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.39,0:17:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Nonsense,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.30,0:17:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler's insane. Of course\Nthat duelist is Merrick. I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.75,0:17:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,with Joey His opponent doesn't\Nseem like the madman Who's
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.79,0:17:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,been trying to steal my Millennium\NPuzzle And I don't sense
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.73,0:17:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,the same evil around him\Neither But if he's not Merrick,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.57,0:17:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,then who could he be?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.43,0:17:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So, where's the real snake in the grass?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.29,0:17:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.79,0:17:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.91,0:17:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm exposed, my entire\Nplan will be ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.33,0:17:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,In addition to Yugi's puzzle\Nand Egyptian god card,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.07,0:17:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I also need Kaiba's card,\NObelisk the Tormentor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.03,0:17:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And I need to learn Kaiba's\Nrole in this ancient
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.97,0:17:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,struggle before my\Nsecret identity is known.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.29,0:17:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.49,0:18:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the real Merrick wields\Nthe power of the Millennium Rod.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.69,0:18:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of that before you listen to those\Nsenseless voices inside of you, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.37,0:18:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.28,0:18:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, it's time for\Nme to finish this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.59,0:18:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mystical Beast Circuit,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.17,0:18:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,attack his life points directly\Nand end this duel immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.93,0:18:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.65,0:18:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.01,0:18:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Odeon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.31,0:18:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop your attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.19,0:18:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it stopped!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.39,0:18:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.63,0:18:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not attacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.15,0:18:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't Joey be a scorpion\Nsnack right about now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.13,0:18:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I held back my attack as you\Nrequested, Master Merrick. But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.27,0:18:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to destroy him\Nwith the Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.45,0:18:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Play the winged dragon of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.27,0:18:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only way to convince\Neveryone that you are me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.99,0:19:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,My true identity must be kept a secret\Nif I am to gain the power of the barrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.31,0:19:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's too dangerous, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.45,0:19:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, don't make me remove the winged\Ndragon of Ra from the sacred Ark!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.13,0:19:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Play that Egyptian god card\Nnow so that I may rule as Nero!
